    "zh-CN": "新增 Fusion 多模型调度，可在一次任务中组合多个模型；补齐 Kimi、CodeBuddy、Qwen 的用量显示与相对路径图片解析。更新流程改为 VS Code 式：检测到新版本后在后台自动下载，下载完成后在侧栏顶部显示「更新」按钮，点击即可安装并重启，无需再手动下载或安装。macOS App 为开发签名、未公证；Windows 安装包未签名；Android APK 为调试签名，iOS IPA 为开发签名，仅可安装到团队已注册设备。",
    "en": "Added Fusion multi-model scheduling so one task can combine several models, plus usage readings for Kimi, CodeBuddy, and Qwen and relative image paths. Updates now work like VS Code: a new release downloads in the background, then an Update button appears at the top of the sidebar; one click installs and restarts without a separate download. The macOS app is development-signed and unnotarized. Windows installers are unsigned. The Android APK is debug-signed and the iOS IPA is development-signed, installing only on registered team devices."
